 corruption once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/93c73eec6323a1b68b763d60b6089e82.poster.avif?t=1761249921\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/93c73eec6323a1b68b763d60b6089e82.webm?t=1761249921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/93c73eec6323a1b68b763d60b6089e82.mp4?t=1761249921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/0a5fb14db93266ddb5375b512383eaca.avif?t=1761249921\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p>","developers":["Not a Duck"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/473db8044f25be82aa68f56117855e4e67a5e6aa/header.jpg?t=1761249921","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+, SteamOS 3.0 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4670 / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 950 / AMD Radeon R7 370 (Drivers: NVIDIA 470+, Mesa 21.0+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3516420/1188654520/0600a35ab327dee93af31615d419b8a4a1e6e0f4/1759358190/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759358631","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.ste